    "title": "One Transported Via Helicopter To Sioux Falls Hospital After Crash Near Rock Valley - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By scottv@kiwaradio.com ,\n7 hours ago Rock Valley, Iowa– A Sioux Falls, SD man was flown to a Sioux Falls hospital after a crash near Rock Valley on Wednesday, August 12, 2026. The Iowa State Patrol reports that at about 9:30 a.m., 58-year-old Dustin Schouten of Sioux Falls, SD was driving a 2023 Dodge truck southbound on L30, or Elmwood Avenue, a mile and a half north of Rock Valley. They tell us that 46-year-old Jesse Van Diepen of Boyden was northbound on L30 in a 2024 Peterbilt semi. Read full article",
